  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    ACTS Common Course - MATH 1305.\n\nPrerequisite: A math ACT score of 21 or above; score of 530 or above on the math section of RSAT; score of 253 or above on the quantitative reasoning, algebra, and statistics section of ACCUPLACER; or earn a grade of C or better in MATH 1113.\n\nThis course is designed to provide additional mathematical background before enrolling in the calculus sequence.\n\nNote: A grade of C of better must be earned in this course if being used to satisfy the general education mathematics requirement.\n    \n</section>",
